Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "Whoa, Link! I can't believe it!
This island is floating in the sky!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "Hah! Every last human in these lands will
fall to my blade!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "That Volga, so full of himself. He forgets that
it is I, Ghirahim, who leads the demon tribe.",
  "1.0.3.0" => "At this rate, we're bound to lose Skyloft!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Is that dragon knight from before in charge
of the opposing forces? We can take him!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "There are plenty of enemies near our base
already! You should be careful!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Oh my! That lightning near the base is
keeping enemies away!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "I must defend the humans' base...",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Ah, so the Great Spirit of the Sky has shown
up... Levias, you flying nuisance! Begone!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Help, someone! They're stealing Lord
Levias's soup! It's vital he gets it!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "We need that soup to persuade Levias to
connect the paths for us! Without it...",
  "1.0.12.0" => "Sounds like we've got to get that soup back.
Let's head to the Goddess Statue and help!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "Thank you for coming to our aid! We have
to guard this soup for Skyloft's sake!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Ack! I'm done for...
Someone...protect...the soup...!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Oh no! The enemy's broken through!
We have to hurry to the Goddess Statue!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "Link... Master... I wait for you underneath the
Goddess Statue...",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Hey, listen! Did you hear that voice just now?
It's coming from under the Goddess Statue!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Link. Greetings. Until our shared mission is
complete, please allow me to call you Master.",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Use this soup to convince Lord Levias to help!
We'd do it, but we're a little...um...wounded...",
  "1.0.20.0" => "I shall carry this pumpkin soup.",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Can you...help our friends too? They're
stranded north of the Academy Keep!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "We can't leave anyone behind!
We have to help them!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Oh, but how can you help your friends when
the road is impassable...? Such a quandary...",
  "1.0.24.0" => "The Skyloft soldiers say that Levias will
connect the road if we ask him! Let's go!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Master, carrying this soup and calling Levias
will help us advance. I shall assist in this task.",
  "1.0.26.0" => "I have completed my transport of the soup.",
  "1.0.27.0" => "Ho ho! My favorite soup!
Did you bring it for me?",
  "1.0.28.0" => "The road is open once more... Well, taking the
enemy's base should brighten my mood.",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Master, I shall aid the allied troops. Please
take care of the enemy commander.",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Take care of the enemy commander?
With pleasure! C'mon, Link!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Thanks for the help! Hey, uh... Could you
carry this soup to the western edge?",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Ugh... Can't go any farther. Take...this
pumpkin soup...to the western cliff...",
  "1.0.34.0" => "The enemy has improved its morale.
Master, use caution when fighting.",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Master, I will transport the soup to its destination.",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Master, there is an 85% chance that this soup
will call Lord Levias to assist us again.",
  "1.0.37.0" => "It's time to flatten the humans' base! And I
may as well destroy some humans while I'm there!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Oh no! They're going after our base!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Grrr. These fools are so insensitive...
Volga! Make yourself useful!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Master, the second batch of soup has been
properly transported.",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Ho ho... Was it you who called me?
Shall I connect the paths for you again?",
  "1.0.42.0" => "Master, further progress can be made.
The Enemy Base is now accessible.",
  "1.0.43.0" => "Hoorah! Now we can take on that dragon
knight!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Master, a faction of enemies is advancing on
the Allied Base. A defense may be needed.",
  "1.0.45.0" => "Ahh, this might just be interesting. Are you
ready to fight a real warrior?",
  "1.0.46.0" => "The dragon knight's out! Let's show him why
he should have stayed hidden!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "My dragon's blood has begun to boil...
Come at me, fools!",
  "1.0.48.0" => "Disappointing! Come at me again!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Don't make me laugh! I was expecting a battle
worth my time, not this child's play!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "How impudent... If only I were at full strength, I
would crush that dragon like the snake he is...",
  "1.0.51.0" => "Master, I have a suggestion. The local Great
Fairy may be able to increase Levias's strength.",
  "1.0.52.0" => "The Great Fairy? Where is she? Over there?
We'll have to defeat some enemies first!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Excellent! Now, use the Magic Circle and
ask the Great Fairy to lend us her strength!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Master, I strongly recommend using the
Magic Circle.",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Is that enough divine intervention for you?
Good. I grow tired...",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Ugh... How could you...?",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Master, Volga is weak. You must deliver
the final blow!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "My strength is insufficient to stop Volga.",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Fi is surrounded! We have to help her! Her?
It? Whatever--let's just go help!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "I would have defeated you if not for the
Sky Lord's interference...",
  "1.0.61.0" => "We won! Phew! That should give us a chance
to breathe easy for a second or two!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "You had us worried for a minute there!
Thanks for pulling through!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "How drab. I should bring this little moment to
an end to make things a bit more tolerable.",
  "1.0.64.0" => "No... On second thought, it might be more fun
to destroy them from the inside... Ha ha ha!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "Hrk--!
                ...What is your bidding, master?",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Our base has fallen!
It's all over, Link!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "Continuing the battle is no longer an option.
My apologies, Master.",
  "1.0.68.0" => "S-s-someone, please help!
We can't carry the soup like this!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "H-help! The soup is in danger!",
  "1.0.70.0" => "Lord Levias, we ask for your help to defeat
those threatening the sky. Will you aid us?",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Ah yes. So the roads have crumbled?
Well, let me see what I can do...",
  "1.0.72.0" => "Pardon me! Would you mind carrying
this soup to the western cliff? Thanks!",
  "1.0.73.0" => "I will wait for Levias here while you dispatch
the enemy commander.",
  "1.0.74.0" => "Master, please make haste to the Great Fairy.
I can distract Volga while you accomplish this.",
  "1.0.75.0" => "Their southern defenses appear to be lacking.
Servants, invade their base from the south!",
  "1.0.76.0" => "What are you doing sneaking about?
I suppose I'll have to destroy you myself.",
  "1.0.77.0" => "Stop the floating blue girl! While you do
that, I'll take the goody-goodies' base!",
  "1.0.78.0" => "Attack! Take their keep by force!",
  "1.0.79.0" => "Oh, Volga, imitation isn't necessary. There is
only one Ghirahim, and thankfully, it's me!",
  "1.0.80.0" => "I can confirm that our keep is safe.
Our forces have performed admirably.",
  "1.0.81.0" => "Come! Destroy these insolent weaklings'
base!",
  "1.0.82.0" => "Yessssss! Now is our turnssssss!",
  "1.0.83.0" => "Gya! Will follow ordersssss!",
  "1.0.84.0" => "I will dispatch the Lizalfos Chieftain.
Master, you must handle the Dinolfos.",
  "1.0.85.0" => "So...ssssstrong...",
  "1.0.86.0" => "Gya! Pain... Failure...",
  "1.0.87.0" => "I can confirm that both the Lizalfos and
Dinolfos Chieftains have been defeated.",
  "1.0.88.0" => "I can confirm that the Allied Base is safe.",
  "1.0.89.0" => "Cowards! If you can still fight, fight on and
push forward!",
}